      "question": "Lesion",
      "preferredVariantId": "v-f0ac37f322",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "v-f0ac37f322",
          "answer": "Causes loss or reduction of taste from the anterior two-thirds of the tongue and reduced submandibular and sublingual salivary secretion; general tongue sensation is preserved if the lingual nerve itself is intact.",
